---
title: Northwestern Cake
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 25-30 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@shortening{0.5%cup}
@sugar{1%cup}
@dark molasses{1%cup}
@eggs{2}
@salt{1%dash}
@hot water{1%cup}
@flour{2%cups}
@soda{0.5%tsp}
@baking powder{2%tsp}
@cinnamon{1%tsp}
@cloves{1%tsp}
@allspice{0.25%tsp}
@sugar

Bake at 350 degrees until done (around 25-30 minutes). Test with a toothpick. Sprinkle with sugar as soon as it comes out of the oven.
